														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4560294">
									

<p>Hey guys I'm a really <em>really</em> small game developer. I'm currently working on a multiplayer shooter called BorderLine (similar to the classic build and battle games seen on Roblox because I loved those as a kid). That's sort of off topic though, as I came here to share my new game idea.</p>
<p>I am a huge fan of the SCP:CB game as well as the now popular SCP:SL game on steam. I've been seriously considering starting a side project similar to SCP:CB but made in Unreal Engine 4, and possible adding new features that are not present in SCP:CB Unity or the original. I've got some ideas already like a co-op mode and maybe the option to start as a scientist or MTF instead of the classic D-Class, but I really want to know what <em>you</em> would want to see in an SCP game. Or maybe you don't want another SCP:CB clone and you have a better, completely different idea!</p>
<p>I welcome all ideas and would love some feedback so I can maybe start development on it! Also if you want to know more about BorderLine, just ask, as I have not set up a website or any similar means of getting news about the game to the internet.</p>

							</div>

								
					
