<p>There are a ton of otherworldy dimensions which I think would be interesting to explore.<br />
There are also things like <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-4335">4335</a>, so basically some anomaly that lives in a game. Remaking the games in some primitive way and inserting the scp may be neat.</p>
<p>There is also an scp I <em>CANNOT</em> for the life of me find anymore, which basically consists of a DVD player and remote that allow full spatial and temporal movement in any inserted media, including through screens in those media. I am unsure if that can be replicated, but I think there are a ton of things like these, that would be really neat to have visually, sometimes even just as a walking sim.</p>

